WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.390
<i>It's the World Duel Carnival Preliminary Round!</i>

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:07.940
<i>Using Heartland City as the battlefield, the strongest Duelists from all around the world</i>

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.730
<i>compete against each other, betting their Heart Pieces.</i>

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:15.280
<i>You qualify for the Finals when you collect five Heart Pieces!</i>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.700
<i>I don't care who it is, just bring it on!</i>

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.950
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.120
Well... Guess I really made you worry.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.870
Me and the Class Rep are doing okay now.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:06.170
Well, if you call "okay" couping himself up in his house.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:08.580
Good! Glad to hear!

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:12.460
Yuma's the only one who won in our group.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.260
The tournament is filling up.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.300
You can be sure that the remaining participants are quite the competition.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.680
Don't let your guard down.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.890
Right, I keep telling you to leave it to me!

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.270
Hey, I sort of feel like we're forgetting about someone.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:24.730
Huh?

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:25.730
Me too.

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.770
I'm still remaining.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:29.940
Cat-<i>chan</i>!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:32.150
I've collected three.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.360
Cat-<i>chan</i>, that's awesome!

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.700
I collected four!

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:42.200
And you barely made it through any of those matches.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.290
D-Don't make it sound that way!

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.040
I just had a bit of a close call, is all!

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.370
Really? "Just a bit," huh?

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.710
You really think so?

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.090
Listen, you!

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.960
You saw my bravery, didn't you?!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.510
H-Hey!

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.470
My Heart Piece!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.390
Give 'em back!

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:09.520
Why's that dog taking your Heart Pieces?

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.150
What're you gonna do? You're going to be disqualified at this rate!

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:15.940
I-I don't know what to do~!

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.420
I-It's a buncha cats this time?

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.380
My kitties, go search for Yuma's Heart Pieces!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.230
Kotori, aren't you going to ask some birds to search?
 (Note: "Tori" = "Bird")

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.230
I... can't do anything like that.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.770
Oh, is that so?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.400
You can't, huh?

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.740
Clean. Clean.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.000
Really?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.250
You know where the dogs are?

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.440
Wh-What're those guys doing?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:32.230
That's...!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:34.150
Yuma's Heart Pieces!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.820
Yuma, let me take care of this.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.000
You've got nowhere left to run! Return Yuma's Heart Pieces!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.790
Stop it at once, ya'll!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.170
What's all the ruckus about?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.880
A-A dog!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.170
It spoke!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:08.010
This here's some Heart Pieces! Don't tell me ya'll been stealin'!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.310
Ya damn fools!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.270
Th-The heck is going on here?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.320
Why'd the dogs take the Heart Pieces?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.400
These here Heart Pieces belong to ya'll?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:27.280
I hope ya'll forgive my followers.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.080
Well...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.450
You thieving dogs!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.200
Huh?!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.540
You can apologize to the police all you want!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.250
Say what?! I thought I heard you call us thieving dogs...

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:41.050
But isn't it true?! Dogs are always up to no good!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.210
Like that little act, for starters!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.680
They always turn and stare up at you with that fake expression!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.800
You fall in love with that pug and want to call him "Hito-chan"!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.680
You feel sorry for it and you lose all your sense!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:51.060
Why are you making that weird face, anyway?!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.850
Say what now?!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.520
Then how about ya'll, then?

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:01.530
And you peaceful looking cats are always scheming something!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.780
Pipe down!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.410
Since it's come to this, let's settle it with a Duel!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.330
With a Duel?!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.080
That's just what I wanted!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.580
Eh?!

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:24.300
And if I end up winning, you dogs will leave this city immediately!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.640
I'll return those words right back to you, cats!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.850
I-Is she really gonna Duel a dog?

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.600
My Heart Pieces...

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:40.110
I can feel it. This is a fated showdown between dogs and cats stretching over millions of years.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.520
And why are you so carefree about this?!

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:44.780
Those're my Heart Pieces!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.110
Duel Disk, set!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.280
Duel Disk, set!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.160
D-Gazer, set!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.340
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:04.880
Duel!!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:09.070
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:12.120
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:19.380
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:28.640
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:33.140
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:39.600
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:44.400
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:50.070
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:55.330
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.210
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.500
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:06.670
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:09.260
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:12.430
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:17.980
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.480
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.480
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:30.280
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.810
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:43.770
"Number 39: Fated Showdown!
 Cat-<i>chan</i> VS Dog-<i>chan</i>"

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.770
Cat-<i>chan</i>, please don't forget about my Heart Pieces!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.770
Cats always dash forward!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.480
My turn, draw!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.400
I Summon Stray Cat!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.030
It's got 100 Attack Points?!

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.700
What a weak Monster!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.710
No, she's most likely...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.580
<i>I need to find something fast that'll trick the dog into sinking its teeth in.</i>

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:09.590
<i>I'll place a Monster for it to attack as a decoy and I'll counter it.</i>

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.050
I then set two cards face-down, ending my turn!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.470
It's my turn! Draw!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.180
The dog drew...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.690
...a card?!

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.230
I Summon Triple-Dog!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:34.860
And when Triple-Dog is on the field, I can Special another Triple-Dog from my hand.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:43.210
Then I activate the Magic Card, Double Dog!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:51.630
When I have two Triple-Dogs on my field, I can Special Summon another Triple-Dog from my deck!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.090
He's got three Level Four Monsters?!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.130
I don't believe it!

00:08:55.130 --> 00:09:01.520
I Overlay my three Level Four Triple-Dogs!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:06.600
I build the Overlay Network with my three Monsters!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:08.900
Xyz Summon!

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.990
Come forth, legendary dog from the older days!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.410
Smoking Dog!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.240
How can a dog Xyz Summon?!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:28.790
Damn! How is it everyone has such good tactics to Xyz Summon so well?!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:29.130
Perhaps its Dueling tactics are better than yours, Yuma.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:29.840
Shut it!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:33.760
<i>That's it! Go ahead and bite onto it, and become my prey!</i>

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:38.390
I activate the Magic Card, Wanderbull!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:44.730
This card Special Summons two Wanderbull Tokens onto my field.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:49.110
And then, I activate the Equipment Magic, Dog-cking!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:58.660
Dog-cking raises the Attack Power of the equipped Monster by 500 points for each Dog Monster on the field.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:05.160
I've got three Dog Monsters on my field, so that's 1500 points!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.870
It's got 4100 Attack Points!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:12.130
At this rate, Cat-<i>chan</i>... My Heart Pieces will...!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.630
That's right! It's a WOOF-Turn Kill elimination!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.720
Go, Smoking Dog!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.100
Attack Stray Cat!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.060
Trap Card, open! Cat's Deception!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:29.400
When the opposing Monster tries to attack my Stray Cat,

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:33.940
the attack is negated and that Monster is sent back to your hand!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.200
I anticipated your cat-like shallow thinking.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.200
Huh?

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:43.030
I activate Smoking Dog's effect!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:49.420
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can negate a Trap Card's activation and destroy it!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.380
Smoking Dog had such an effect?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.380
It really is a One Turn Kill!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:00.050
Cat-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.890
I win, ya'll.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.760
Are you sure about that?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.350
Hmm?

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:11.060
I aligned myself just right to absorb Smoking Dog's attack.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.480
I activated the Quick-Play Magic, Cat Food!

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:22.200
This card released Stray Cat and Special Summoned Stray Catgirl!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:31.920
And when Stray Catgirl is in Attack Mode, she can't be destroyed in battle!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.170
Quite a crafty way to do so.

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:38.130
But you only got 500 of your Life remaining. You're about as good as dog food!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.840
I set a card face-down and end my turn!

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:48.100
And at the end of the turn, the Dog Tokens are destroyed by their own effect.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:54.020
Now you've done it! You saw through a human's trap, even though you're just a mangy dog!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.230
Silence, ya stupid cat girl!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.070
My turn! Draw!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.740
Behold, you foolish dogs who can only obey humans!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.660
The noble spirit and the power of freedom cats possess!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.250
I Summon Cat Girl!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.170
I Overlay my Level Four Stray Catgirl and Cat Girl!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:24.260
I build the Overlay Network with my two Monsters!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.800
Xyz Summon!

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:29.140
Come on out, Cat Girl Magician!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:39.860
Then I activate the Equipment Magic, Catnip Turbine!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:47.830
This card increases the Attack Power of one of my Cat Monsters by 1200 points!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:54.040
Good going, Cat-<i>chan</i>! Now it's got more Attack Power and the opposing Monster!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:58.790
But I can't attack with the Monster I powered up with this effect!

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.840
So you're really just a foolish cat in the end.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.010
Don't be so sure.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.510
I activate the effect of Cat Girl Magician!

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:13.480
By detaching one Overlay Unit and halving her Attack Power during this turn,

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.060
I am able to attack you directly!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.650
What'd ya say?!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.650
Go, Cat Girl Magician!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.690
Cat's Eye Magic!!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.660
All right!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.700
I set two cards face-down and end my turn!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.420
Now Cat Girl Magician's Attack Power will return to normal!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.000
Well?! Did you learn how foolish dogs are yet?!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:48.220
How dare you...! How dare a lowly cat rebel against us dogs?!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:51.140
I ain't ever gonna forgive ya!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.600
A little girl?!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.060
Huh?!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:00.480
Eh... Uh, huh? Um...

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:06.570
Wh-What the heck is going on?

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:10.160
A little girl just came out of that barrel!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.830
Is that little girl actually the one Dueling?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.120
So it wasn't really the dog?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:21.790
In that case, it would mean a little girl's Dueling tactics are better than yours, Yuma.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.840
Shut up!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.300
What's your name?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.260
Dog.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.590
Eh?

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:31.640
Dog.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.260
What?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.600
I told you, it's Dog! I'm called Dog-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:43.900
Dog-<i>chan</i>...? Why are you Dueling while riding on top of a dog?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.900
I-I'm... I...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.860
I'm too scared to talk with other people.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.570
So I've always been alone.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:59.080
Chukichi is my only friend, but I liked to Duel.... I loved Dueling...

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.540
I used to Duel against Chukichi all the time.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.880
Chukichi tried desperately to remember how to Duel.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.300
He finally was able to draw a card.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:15.510
And he Dueled against me day after day.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:19.730
But I really wanted to Duel against other people!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:24.520
That's why I disguised myself as Chukichi and entered this tournament.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:29.110
But I was too scared to talk to people I didn't know, after all.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.950
So then what do you want to do?

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:31.660
Eh?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.870
Do you want to continue the Duel?

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:36.830
Or do you want to surrender as you are now?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.790
Hmph. I guess this is all you dog lovers can do.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.040
H-Hey...

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.210
Be quiet!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:51.130
Are you fine always hiding behind a dog's shadow?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.980
You'll be a loser dog the rest of your life!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.440
Hmph! You're wrong!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:05.150
But I'm not wrong, am I? You're too scared to Duel on your own!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.960
Duel Disk, set!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.210
I challenge you!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.000
That's just what I want!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.930
What a thing to happen!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:38.350
I can't believe it went from Dog VS Cat Girl to Dog Girl VS Cat Girl!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.100
My turn! Draw!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:44.810
I activate the Magic Card, Wan Chance!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:53.240
If I control no Level Three or lower Monsters on my field, I can Special Summon four Wanchance Tokens onto the field.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:57.280
As my dog friends increase, the effect of the Equipment Magic, Dog-cking,

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:01.410
raises the Attack Power of my Smoking Dog 2000 points!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:06.080
Battle! I use Smoking Dog to attack Cat Girl Magician!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.710
Trap Card, open!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.300
Gold Coins for Cats!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:17.640
When my cats are attacked, I can add half the Attack Power of the opponent

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.100
to the Attack Power of my Monster!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:24.810
She's got 5750 Attack Points! She's stronger than Smoking Dog!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:28.020
Not yet. She's still got the effect of Smoking Dog.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.980
I activate Smoking Dog's effect!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:35.950
I detach one Overlay Unit to negate your Trap effect!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:47.000
Oh crap! The cat's Attack Power returned to normal!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.500
I've been waiting for that.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:55.470
Even if Smoking Dog makes Trap effects invalid, it can't make Magic effects invalid!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:18:01.760
The card I set on my field was the Quick-Play Magic, Counter Nyaunter!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:08.480
When one of my Trap Cards is destroyed, I can destroy one of my opponent's Magic or Trap Cards.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:14.360
Then, I can double the Attack Power of one of my Cat Monsters until the end of the turn!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:15.940
No way!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.780
The card I destroy is the Equipment Magic, Dog-cking!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:24.750
If I destroy that card, Smoking Dog's Attack Power will return to 2600!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:30.460
And the Attack Power of my Cat Girl Magician will rise up to 6400!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.710
You have nothing left to... protect!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.550
I've turned this match around!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.470
<i>It's no use. I can't win...</i>

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:46.140
<i>I guess I just can't do anything on my own.</i>

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.120
Just give up! You're just a loser dog!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.540
Bring it to 'er!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.420
Don't you ever give up! Bring it to 'er, Dog-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:20.380
That's right, Dog-<i>chan</i>! Bring it to 'er!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.140
Never give up and always challenge yourself!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.890
Don't give up, Dog-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.140
Never, ever give up!

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.320
Mm, that's right! I can't let myself give up!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.900
I am not a loser dog!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:41.030
I'm gonna dog it to 'em!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.410
Trap Card, open! Defiant Howl!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:52.620
This card destroys one of my own Equipment Magics,

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:56.800
and returns the Attack Power of all Monsters on the field to their original value!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:02.510
You destroyed your own Equipment Magic. Good of you to come to that realization.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.760
Go, Smoking Dog!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.200
I won...?

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.740
I won!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.040
I won! I really won!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.710
You did it, Dog-<i>chan</i>! That's the way!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.000
My Heart Pieces!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.350
I'm sorry. I'll give these back to you.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.980
Th-Those are my...!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.860
My Heart Pieces!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.820
And these are my Heart Pieces.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.070
Take them.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.530
Eh...? But...

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.700
You won, didn't you?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.870
Yeah...

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.580
You brought the dog pretty well out there.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:16.920
I used to always only have cats as my friends.

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.380
Eh?

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.090
But once I worked up the courage to cat it to 'em...

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.550
I started Dueling.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.300
And I made some friends.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.140
I made friends with everyone through Dueling.

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:33.520
You became friends with everyone through Dueling?

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.690
Did you lose on purpose?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.110
Take a look.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.950
<i>Observation #18...</i>

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.330
<i>"Cat it to 'em, Dog it to 'em...</i>

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:55.580
<i>There are many ways to bring it to 'em waiting in this world.</i>

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.880
<i>I wonder if there's a way to connect people around the world this way."</i>

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:02.750
Yes! I'm gonna bring it to 'em with all I got tomorrow!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:06.220
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.980
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:28.910
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.870
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:41.460
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:45.550
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:48.340
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:52.800
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:55.850
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.350 --> 00:22:59.140
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:06.230
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:09.280
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:13.740
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:15.700
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:17.500
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.880
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:25.920
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:29.510
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:33.930
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:35.760
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.060
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:44.560
Kaito's little brother Haruto suddenly appeared in the city!

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:46.860
Just where are you going?

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:47.980
That kid's in danger!

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:50.860
Are you able to see me?!

00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:53.620
Are you looking for your older brother?

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:57.120
If this continues, everything will be swallowed up!

00:23:57.120 --> 00:24:01.540
I understand, Haruto. I promise to take you to Kaito's home!

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:04.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:06.630
"The Visitor from Heartland, Haruto"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:08.460
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!
